; PRACTICA — strategic navigator for verisectorium
; Areas of active work, with priority. Items within areas belong closer to the work
; (plan/OUTLINE.md rows, INFLUX indexes); this stays the top of the strategy DAG.
; Vanilla udon, transitional (.un) per NORMS.md.

|template
  ; best current guess at an area record's shape — evolve freely
  |area[slug] :priority primary|secondary :state active|paused|done :opened <date>
    :why one line on why this area matters now
    :next the single most useful next act, if known
    Body: whatever orientation the area needs — kept short; deep material
    belongs in plan/ segments or INFLUX notes, referenced by [[slug]].

|area[flesh-out-plan-outline] :priority primary :state active :opened <2026-08-05>
  :why The plan outline (plan/OUTLINE.md) is the organizing principle for the whole
       project; its ~55 undrafted rows and 17 gaps are the work
  :next Draft the ch. 7 principles segments first — everything else claims to trace to them
  Drafting segments into plan/last-adhoc-src/ per plan/ONTOLOGY.un conventions.
  Prefer segments that other chapters' rows already cross-reference ([[turnover-solution]],
  [[collision-staleness-detection]], [[state-flags-not-gates]]).

|area[plan-influx-processing] :priority primary :state active :opened <2026-08-05>
  :why plan/INFLUX/ holds the full 2026-08-05 notes gather (shape + health of every
       estate instance) — the evidence base the plan segments will cite; unprocessed,
       it is exactly the drown-in-noise state verisectoria exist to end
  :next First dispatch in flight (fresh-eyes residue audit over the 12 drafted segments)
  Discipline decided (Joseph, 2026-08-05): done means INFLUX is *empty* — everything in
  .integrated (content has a home in segments) or .archive (not-landing / copy of live
  authority). Method: a fresh agent reads the drafted segments FIRST, then overlapping
  notes, reports residue the segments missed, records residue durably, then dispatches.
  Entry point: plan/INFLUX/00-INDEX.md. Provenance banners on copies name live sources;
  originals win on conflict.
